            <div class="content-section">
                <div class="section-heading">WELCOME TO AUC.</div>
                <p>These next four years will be challenging, but they will also be the most stimulating and rewarding years of your life. We are excited to welcome you to AUC School of Medicine as you begin this important journey.</p>
                <p>Please use this guide to help prepare for your travels and enjoy the beauty of Sint Maarten. AUC's Office of Admissions and dedicated AUC teams are here to answer any questions you may have. Refer to page 44 for contact details.</p>
                <p>AUC offers an intimate and unique learning environment that has long been cultivated and nurtured by our faculty, students, and staff. Here, you're a part of a tight-knit community where collective success and collaboration are a priority.</p>
                <p>Welcome to the AUC family! Wishing you much success on the journey ahead.</p>
                <p><strong><span data-field="dean.name">{{ dean.name }}</span></strong><br>
                University Dean</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
