                <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>NOTE:</strong> Bulk shipping is the most economical manner to deliver larger personal items such as books, televisions, and computers to Sint Maarten. This means, however, that packages will be consolidated in Miami as an interim destination. For further information, please contact the following shipping companies:</p>
