<div class="page">
    <h2 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">ON-CAMPUS HOUSING:</h2>
    <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 0;">UNIVERSITY APARTMENTS</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Furnished student apartments are available for incoming students on a first-come, first-served basis. Our one- and two-bedroom units are outfitted with an air conditioning unit, desk, chairs, sofa, dining table, refrigerator, stove, microwave, bed, dresser, and shower curtains. Units include a fully equipped kitchen, as well as dining and living areas. Those in double units enjoy a balcony with beautiful ocean and bayside views. Your amenities, including wireless internet, utilities, and water, are included in the apartment list price. We also have laundry facilities on site; expect to pay $1-$2 per cycle. Please be aware that university apartments are not supplied with bedding or bath items. Therefore, we recommend that these particular items be brought to the island or purchased upon arrival:</p>
    <ul style="font-size: 11pt; list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li>bedding: full XL sheets (54"x80")</li>
        <li>pillow and case</li>
        <li>bedspread/comforter</li>
        <li>clothes hangers</li>
        <li>lamps</li>
        <li>throw rugs</li>
        <li>mattress pad/cover</li>
        <li>bathroom towels, bath rugs</li>
        <li>additional items: iron, alarm clock, small transistor radio, cleaning supplies, garbage bins, can/bottle opener, first aid kit, power surge protector, flashlight, and batteries</li>
    </ul>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <!-- Image placeholder area -->
        </div>
        <div style="width: 48%;">
            <!-- Image placeholder area -->
            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">THE DEPARTMENT OF HOUSING & RESIDENTIAL LIFE</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 11pt;">is staffed from <span data-field="hours.start_time">{{ hours.start_time }}</span> to <span data-field="hours.end_time">{{ hours.end_time }}</span>, Monday through Friday. The Office of Safety & Security is also available to assist students with move-in and move-out procedures, including weekends. On housing check-in dates, the Department of Housing & Residential Life will have extended hours.</p>
                <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Email <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span> for more information.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

