            <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Telém and FLOW ("Chippie") are the major mobile service and cellular providers in Sint Maarten. Students can visit these providers at their local branch offices. A prepaid SIM card typically costs $20 and call credit is about $10. There are different packages available for call minutes and data, and students can add credit to their account as needed. Monthly packages are also available. You can purchase a SIM card from most local grocery stores. AUC students and family members can also access a complimentary international phone in the AUC cafeteria.</p>
