            <h3 style="font-size: 16pt;">INTERNET</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 11pt;">AUC is a wireless campus with internet access available to students for study and appropriate personal use. Students can connect to the wireless network on their own device or use computers in our campus computer lab, which are available during library hours. Students living in the university apartments have access to the campus wireless network from their rooms.</p>
