            <p style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 20px;">Off campus, students have the choice of several local internet service providers, including Telém and FLOW. Most providers offer DSL, wireless DSL, and 4G service. Depending on the provider, type of service, and level of service, start-up costs can range from $100 to $250 with monthly rates ranging from $50 to $120. Students will be able to meet with internet service providers during the university's business fair and can purchase and schedule the installation of internet service.</p>
