            <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The AUC campus is located in Cupecoy, which is not serviced by a public bus line. Taxi services are available throughout the island. A fare from the airport to AUC will cost approximately $20. Extra passengers and/or bags will cost an additional fee. Taxis in Sint Maarten are cash-only, so please plan accordingly. During evening hours, AUC offers a courtesy shuttle service from campus to surrounding neighborhoods (Maho, Beacon Hill, Blue Residence, etc.). The shuttle operates between 5:00 pm and 1:00 am seven days a week. To request the shuttle from campus, visit the Welcome Center or call 721-588-4018 (calls can be received through WhatsApp).</p>
