      <p style="line-height: 1.6;">Your first week at AUC is all about exploring our campus and facilities, getting to know your peers, preparing for your courses, and setting into life as an AUC student. Visit <a href="#" style="color: blue;">aucmed.edu/about/events/welcome-week</a> for a complete schedule of welcome week activities.</p>
